E8542 `environ["REMOTE_ADDR"]` is not guaranteed by WSGI
 --> wsgi.py:4:14
  |
2 | def application(environ, start_response):
3 |     method = environ["REQUEST_METHOD"]  # OK: guaranteed
4 |     remote = environ["REMOTE_ADDR"]  # E8542
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
5 |     host = request.httprequest.environ["HTTP_HOST"]  # E8542
6 |     agent = environ.get("HTTP_USER_AGENT")  # OK
  |
help: Read it with `.get()` or the request's own accessor

E8542 `environ["HTTP_HOST"]` is not guaranteed by WSGI
